# REVOKED — DO NOT APPLY
#
# This file previously contained a live Hetzner API token and the K3s join token
# in plaintext (see audit 2026-04-14). Those credentials HAVE BEEN ROTATED.
#
# The former in-cluster cluster-autoscaler Deployment is superseded by the
# Hetzner-specific node manager at src/k8s/nodeManager.ts. Running both in
# parallel causes race conditions on Pending pods and orphaned Hetzner servers.
#
# Git history still contains the old token values. A `git filter-repo --path
# jarble-api-main/k8s/cluster-autoscaler.yaml --invert-paths` purge can remove
# them from history; since the tokens are rotated, the historical values are
# benign and the purge is optional.
#
# If the live cluster still has the stale `cluster-autoscaler` Deployment:
#   kubectl -n kube-system get deploy cluster-autoscaler
#   kubectl -n kube-system delete deploy cluster-autoscaler
#   kubectl -n kube-system delete secret hcloud-autoscaler
